Package: edgekit
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/zhihao-advantech/EdgeKit
Description: AI-accelerated edge device debugging console
 EdgeKit is a desktop application for debugging and upgrading edge devices.
 It combines an AI agent session with a serial console, an SSH terminal, SFTP
 file browsing and a local workspace, and can drive several boards at once.
 .
 The web UI is embedded in the binary and runs in a native WebKit2GTK window,
 so no browser or external file is needed. The `edgekit mcp` subcommand exposes
 the same tool surface to external MCP agents (OpenClaw, Claude Code, ...).
 .
 This build targets @WEBKIT_DESC@.
